  {
   "id": "intro_1",
   "text": "11:52 pm. Mum and Dad are stuck across town in the storm, and you're watching your little sister Mira. Twenty minutes ago she slipped outside after the cat. Now the intercom crackles: both door cameras show a small figure in her yellow raincoat, at the front door and the side door, at the same time. One call, two doors.",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "fx": "room"
  },
  {
   "id": "intro_2",
   "text": "12:20 am. She calls again. Same raincoat, same little voice, both doors. Mum's rule, taped to the fridge: “Never open the door at night unless you're sure who it is.”",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "fx": "room"
  },
  {
   "id": "intro_3",
   "text": "1:05 am. The porch light on one side won't stop flickering. Another call. Tonight the call leans toward one of the doors.",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "fx": "room"
  },
  {
   "id": "intro_4",
   "text": "3:33 am. The intercom battery is almost dead. One more call. Somewhere out in the rain, something has learned exactly how she says your name.",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "fx": "room"
  },
  {
   "id": "res_saved",
   "text": "You took forever.",
   "voice": "mira",
   "fx": "child_room"
  },
  {
   "id": "res_wrong",
   "text": "Wrong one.",
   "voice": "mira",
   "fx": "child_distant"
  },
  {
   "id": "mimic_next",
   "text": "Next time.",
   "voice": "mira",
   "fx": "child_eerie"
  },
  {
   "id": "mimic_thanks",
   "text": "Thank you.",
   "voice": "mira",
   "fx": "child_eerie"
  },
  {
   "id": "mimic_letmein",
   "text": "Let me in.",
   "voice": "mira",
   "fx": "child_eerie"
  },
  {
   "id": "stage_goal",
   "text": "Every call, two questions. Who is calling, and which door. Listen to learn who. Trace to learn where.",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "fx": "room"
  },
  {
   "id": "stage_superposition",
   "text": "One call. Two doors. She is at both of them at once. That is superposition.",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "fx": "room"
  },
  {
   "id": "stage_listen",
   "text": "Set the dial to zero, and press Listen.",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "fx": "room"
  },
  {
   "id": "stage_interference",
   "text": "Now turn the dial to four, and listen again.",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "fx": "room"
  },
  {
   "id": "stage_impostor",
   "text": "An impostor's pattern is shifted. Where Mira comes through clear, it gives static.",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "fx": "room"
  },
  {
   "id": "stage_trace",
   "text": "Now trace the call. You will learn the door, and lose the pattern.",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "fx": "room"
  },
  {
   "id": "stage_decide",
   "text": "Tonight, either door is safe. Open one.",
   "voice": "narrator",
   "fx": "room"
  }
